    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.5
  m_Text: "\n\"Death is unavoidable, not only to us, but all that exists or ever has existed. ▼\nEvery living being will eventually die out. ▼\nEvery speck of matter will eventually wither away and dissipate into entropy.\" ▼"
