    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.5
  m_Text: "\n\"You've given me a lot to think about, and while I'm sure I have a long and hard road ahead of me, I'm optimistic. ▼\nFor the first time in what feels like an eternity, I'm optimistic.\" ▼"
