    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.5
  m_Text: "\n\"We are unable to come to terms with it, so we hide from our own intelligence. ▼\nWe set limits. ▼\nWe stop ourselves from thinking deeply about what will happen when we die.\" ▼"
